  "description": "Leticia, the empire’s youngest death row inmate, was released on probation. The Emperor had only one condition for her release. \n\n*“You must become my son.”*\n\nIn other words, she was to pose as the youngest prince, who was to be sent to the Grand Duchy as a hostage. \n\n*“You’re going to die anyway, so die as a prince.”*\n\nFrom that day on, Leticia Borba became the fake prince. To die in place of the real prince.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
